ENGINE_LOADED(3698,{"ws":3698,"brand":"Profound","study":{"id":7136,"name":"B-ORG-WS-90D","created":false,"window":"2026-04-20..2026-07-19","alsoUsed":{"id":7135,"name":"B-ORG-TREND-W4 2026Q2-3","window":"2026-04-01..2026-07-19","pillars":["p3"]}},"pillars":[{"id":"p1","name":"Cut through work overload","name_zh":"穿透工作信息过载","verdict":"emerging","headline":"Simplicity reveals potential in complexity.","headline_zh":"化繁为简，方见潜能。","territory":"Professionals buried in notifications, open tabs and fragmented information, with hustle culture tipping into burnout as AI reshapes work. Semrush drives most of the talk here (34 of 58 posts); Profound has 4 posts.","territory_zh":"职场人被通知、标签页和碎片化信息淹没，在 AI 重塑工作的同时，“拼命文化”正滑向倦怠。该话题主要由 Semrush 主导（58 条中占 34 条），Profound 仅有 4 条。","persona":{"themeId":55085,"title":"The Strategic Innovator","characterId":1270,"characterName":"Evelyn Dataforge","summary":"Tech strategist leading a team at an AI startup: analytical, curious and adaptable, driven by knowledge, growth and recognition, and set on staying ahead of AI, SEO and digital-marketing trends.","created":false,"studyId":7136},"tension":{"themeId":55092,"type":"pain_points","title":"Navigating the Complexities of Modern Work Life","summary":"Constant interruptions and digital overload drive procrastination and overwhelm; hustle culture breeds burnout, and fragmented information sources make decisions harder as AI changes work.","studyId":7136},"angle":{"id":14367,"type":"psychological","title":"Cognitive Overload","text":"Too much information and constant digital interruptions overload limited working memory (Cognitive Load Theory), so people struggle to focus, prioritise and act.","created":false},"story":{"id":1858,"title":"Beyond the Noise","narrative":"Evelyn's startup office hums with notifications and open tabs until the team admits it is \"buried alive in our own ambitions\". They try interruption-free focus time, one idea per week and regular \"digital detox days\". With less cognitive load, conversations get richer and brainstorming deeper: efficiency turns out to mean doing what matters, not doing more.","created":false},"propositions":[{"id":5298,"type":"usp","title":"Simplify. Focus. Thrive.","text":"Transform Complexity into Clarity with AI Smarts. With our AI Marketer, you’ll untangle the mess and focus only on what matters for impactful marketing results.","created":true,"variantId":22534,"focus":"AI Marketer: a marketing expert that investigates your data, identifies opportunities, and does the work while you stay in the loop","storyId":1858},{"id":5297,"type":"rtb","title":"Smart Decisions Made Simple with Profound.","text":"Make Smart Marketing Decisions Effortlessly with Profound. As seen with Plaid's impressive traffic increase, Profound helps brands efficiently navigate the complexities of AI Search.","created":true,"variantId":22526,"focus":"Plaid grew LLM referral traffic by over 300%, with conversions up 210%, using Profound","storyId":1858},{"id":5295,"type":"product_features","title":"Less Stress, More Insight—Revolutionize Your Workflow.","text":"Embrace digital simplicity—transform your productivity with Profound Platform. Leveraging reusable skills, our AI agents reduce cognitive load, making your work life more productive.","created":true,"variantId":22522,"focus":"Agents with reusable Skills and an External MCP that pulls context from Slack, Notion and G2","storyId":1858}],"examples":{"tofu":[{"postId":682464758,"src":"paid","net":"youtube","date":"2025-07-13","img":"ea682464758","text":"Marketing Engineers build and maintain AI Agents, and the best ones use Profound.","metrics":{"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":{"bucket":"BELOW_AVERAGE","conf":0.813},"why":"Brand-level YouTube line with no CTA that frames agents as the way marketing work gets done, the relief from overload this pillar promises; SOMIN predicts below-average clickability.","why_zh":"无行动号召的品牌级 YouTube 广告语，把智能体定位为完成营销工作的方式，呼应本支柱“减负”的承诺；SOMIN 预测其点击力低于平均。","lastSeen":"2026-07-18","placement":["YOUTUBE","VIDEO_PARTNERS"]}],"mofu":[{"postId":682464528,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-04-21","img":"e682464528","text":"Introducing Framer integration node for Profound Agents.\n\nFramer has been one of the few platforms treating AEO as a first-class concern from day one. Now you can wire it directly into your Agents — read live CMS, write new content to it, and keep the … Available today for Enterprise customers.","metrics":{"likes":81,"comments":3,"shares":1,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Feature explainer: wiring Framer's CMS straight into Profound Agents keeps reading and writing content in one loop, a concrete answer to tool-switching overload.","why_zh":"功能讲解：把 Framer CMS 直接接入 Profound Agents，内容读写在一个闭环内完成，直接回应频繁切换工具带来的过载。","textNote":"Caption shortened to 300 characters; the omitted middle is marked with an ellipsis and the closing line is kept."},{"postId":682464591,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-04-27","img":"e682464591","text":"Introducing the Iteration Node Agent.\n\nBuild your steps once, pass in a list, and run them across every item simultaneously, up to 50 at a time.\n\nWith the Iteration Node you can:\n• Process lists of competitors, URLs … Available for all Profound customers. Learn more: https://lnkd.in/dk5hQrmA","metrics":{"likes":35,"comments":1,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Shows one reusable loop replacing dozens of duplicated nodes (up to 50 items at a time), simplicity framed as less repetitive work.","why_zh":"展示一个可复用的循环替代数十个重复节点（一次最多 50 项），把“化繁为简”落到减少重复劳动上。","textNote":"Caption shortened to 300 characters; the omitted middle is marked with an ellipsis and the closing line is kept."},{"postId":682464533,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-06-30","img":"e682464533","text":"June 2026 Feature Roundup\n\n1/ Go from insight to opportunity to execution with Projects in Profound\n\n2/ Ask questions and work with Profound right in Slack without ever leaving the chat \n\n3/ Collaborate on content with your teammates in Profound Docs\n\n4/ Apply reusable … More to come in July.","metrics":{"likes":30,"comments":1,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Six-feature roundup (Projects, Slack, Docs, Skills, sentiment shaping, External MCP) built around going from insight to execution without leaving one platform.","why_zh":"六项功能合集（Projects、Slack、Docs、Skills、情感塑造、External MCP），主旨是在同一平台内从洞察走到执行。","textNote":"Caption shortened to 300 characters; the omitted middle is marked with an ellipsis and the closing line is kept."}],"bofu":[{"postId":682464602,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-06-02","img":"e682464602","text":"Zero Click Eve.\n\nA meet-up series across New York's West Village on June 10. The warm-up to Zero Click by Profound NY and an opportunity to catch up, make friends and enjoy our community. \n\nThank you to our partners for making it happen: iPullRank … Register for ZC Eve → https://lnkd.in/e-ZrbmMZ","metrics":{"likes":28,"comments":2,"shares":3,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Registration post for an in-person community evening before the Zero Click NY summit, a low-noise, offline way in; SOMIN places it in this work-life cluster.","why_zh":"Zero Click 纽约峰会前一晚社区聚会的报名帖，提供线下、低噪音的参与方式；SOMIN 将其归入本工作生活主题。","textNote":"Caption shortened to 300 characters; the omitted middle is marked with an ellipsis and the closing line is kept."},{"postId":682502243,"src":"paid","net":"google_search","date":"2026-07-22","img":"ea682502243","text":"AI Visibility Platform - AI Search Is a Black Box - Analyze Your Brand Free\nAI search is a black box. See how ChatGPT and Gemini and Perplexity describe your brand.","metrics":{"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Search ad that turns an opaque 'black box' into one free brand analysis: clarity out of complexity, with a direct conversion CTA.","why_zh":"搜索广告把不透明的“黑箱”变成一次免费的品牌分析：从复杂中见清晰，并带有直接转化的行动号召。","lastSeen":"2026-07-23","placement":["GOOGLE_SEARCH","SEARCH_PARTNERS"]},{"postId":682464736,"src":"paid","net":"google_search","date":"2025-07-13","img":"ea682464736","text":"AI Visibility Platform - 1B+ Citations Analyzed Daily - Get a Free Brand…\nDon't just track AI visibility - act on it. Autonomous agents + real prompt data.","metrics":{"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Search ad that pitches autonomous agents acting on AI-visibility data instead of another dashboard to watch, closing on a free-offer CTA (headline is cut off in Google's archived image).","why_zh":"搜索广告主张让自主智能体基于 AI 可见度数据直接行动，而不是再多一个要盯的仪表盘，结尾为免费类行动号召（谷歌存档图中标题被截断）。","lastSeen":"2026-07-17","placement":["GOOGLE_SEARCH","SEARCH_PARTNERS"]}]},"kpi":{"evidencePosts":58,"engagement":14095,"brandPosts":4,"brandEng":181},"sov":{"brandShare":7.3,"categoryShare":6.8,"brandPosts":4,"brandTotal":55,"catPosts":54,"catTotal":797},"trend":{"months":["2026-04","2026-05","2026-06","2026-07"],"brand":[2,0,2,0],"category":[11,22,12,9]},"trendNote":"Monthly post counts from posts-aggregate with clusterIds=[55092] over the study window 2026-04-20..2026-07-19; first and last months are partial. Category = the 8 competitor profiles combined."},{"id":"p2","name":"Focus beats spreading thin","name_zh":"聚焦胜过广撒网","verdict":"owned","headline":"In the chaos of choice, less can truly be more.","headline_zh":"选择越纷乱，少即是多。","territory":"Marketers stretched across channels, content demands and thin budgets, with AI and ChatGPT adding new channels to manage. The largest of the three territories (151 posts, 17,534 engagement), and the one where Profound over-indexes.","territory_zh":"营销人被多渠道、内容压力和捉襟见肘的预算拉扯，AI 与 ChatGPT 又带来新的渠道。这是三个话题中最大的一个（151 条帖子，17,534 次互动），也是 Profound 占比高于品类的话题。","persona":{"themeId":55085,"title":"The Strategic Innovator","characterId":1270,"characterName":"Evelyn Dataforge","summary":"Tech strategist leading a team at an AI startup: analytical, curious and adaptable, driven by knowledge, growth and recognition, and set on staying ahead of AI, SEO and digital-marketing trends.","created":false,"studyId":7136},"tension":{"themeId":55094,"type":"pain_points","title":"Navigating Marketing Complexity: Challenges and Solutions","summary":"Brands struggle to keep one voice across platforms under content and lead-conversion pressure; marketers face overwhelm, few actionable insights and wasted budget, while AI and ChatGPT add new channels.","studyId":7136},"angle":{"id":14373,"type":"economic","title":"Resource Allocation","text":"Budgets spread thin across too many channels without a clear strategy run into diminishing returns (Principle of Diminishing Returns); concentrating effort on a few areas yields more.","created":false},"story":{"id":1859,"title":"The Sieve of Efforts","narrative":"Campaigns are busy but the payoff is faint. Evelyn's marketing manager warns that the team has spread itself \"like breadcrumbs scattered across a vast forest\", and the data lead shows that more channels without a cohesive strategy means less everywhere. They prioritise key platforms, streamline budgets and invest deeply rather than broadly, and results follow: strength lies in depth, not breadth.","created":false},"propositions":[{"id":5303,"type":"usp","title":"Less Noise, More Impact with AI Marketer.","text":"Simplify Your Marketing Strategy with AI Precision. The AI Marketer identifies key opportunities in your data, allowing you to concentrate your efforts effectively.","created":true,"variantId":22559,"focus":"AI Marketer: a marketing expert that investigates your data, identifies opportunities, and does the work while you stay in the loop","storyId":1859},{"id":5301,"type":"rtb","title":"Less Complexity. More Clarity. Profound Marketing Made Simple.","text":"When choice feels overwhelming, focus with Profound: Unlock powerful marketing insights with less effort. Our platform streamlines the data process, enabling brands like Plaid to increase referral traffic and conversions by prioritizing impactful strategies.","created":true,"variantId":22549,"focus":"Plaid grew LLM referral traffic by over 300%, with conversions up 210%, using Profound","storyId":1859},{"id":5299,"type":"product_features","title":"Less is More: Elevate Your Marketing with Precision.","text":"Streamline Your Strategy: Focus to Flourish. Our reusable Agents and Integrated MCP allow you to concentrate on the most impactful areas.","created":true,"variantId":22539,"focus":"Agents with reusable Skills and an External MCP that pulls context from Slack, Notion and G2","storyId":1859}],"examples":{"tofu":[{"postId":682464553,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-06-07","img":"e682464553","text":"We hosted our first Marketing Engineering Hackathon yesterday.\n\n50 builders. 8 hours. $40,000 in prizes. Incredible judges from 𝗔𝗻𝘁𝗵𝗿𝗼𝗽𝗶𝗰, 𝗦𝘁𝗿𝗶𝗽𝗲, 𝗥𝗮𝗺𝗽, 𝗚𝗼𝗼𝗴𝗹𝗲, and … More to come at Zero Click by Profound this Thursday June 11. In the meantime, check out our Manifesto https://lnkd.in/eb4XSAGa","metrics":{"likes":247,"comments":31,"shares":19,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Community recap with no hard CTA (50 builders, 8 hours, $40,000 in prizes) that shows marketers shipping focused agents instead of doing more by hand.","why_zh":"没有强行动号召的社区回顾（50 位开发者、8 小时、4 万美元奖金），展示营销人用聚焦的智能体代替更多手工劳动。","textNote":"Caption shortened to 300 characters; the omitted middle is marked with an ellipsis and the closing line is kept."},{"postId":682464692,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-04-27","img":"e682464692","text":"Every marketer in Miami this week is talking about AI.\n\nWe're at POSSIBLE (April 27-29) to talk about what comes after the conversation -- Agents that research, publish, optimize, and … If agentic marketing is on your radar, reach out and meet up wi Benjamin Grosse and Eliott Lee on the ground.","metrics":{"likes":29,"comments":null,"shares":1,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Event-presence post at POSSIBLE Miami: agents that research, publish and scale content 'without adding headcount', with only a soft invitation to meet the team.","why_zh":"POSSIBLE 迈阿密大会的到场帖：智能体能研究、发布并规模化内容，“无需增加人手”，只附带与团队见面的轻量邀请。","textNote":"Caption shortened to 300 characters; the omitted middle is marked with an ellipsis and the closing line is kept."},{"postId":null,"src":"concept","net":"instagram","date":null,"img":"gen3698_2","text":"Concept render, not a published post: one bright sticky note in sharp focus against a wall of blank notes and tangled cables. Made for the planned Instagram post (draft for 2026-10-22) that quotes SOMIN story #1859, 'In the chaos of choice, less can truly be more.'","metrics":{"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Concept only, added because this stage has two real posts; it pictures the one-signal-that-matters idea of story #1859.","why_zh":"仅为概念图，因本阶段只有两条真实帖子而补充；它把故事 #1859 中“只抓最重要的一个信号”的想法视觉化。"}],"mofu":[{"postId":682464572,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-04-28","img":"e682464572","text":"Profound 🤝  Snap Inc. \n\nWe’re excited to welcome Snap as a partner.\n\nSnap has redefined how hundreds of millions of people communicate, discover, and engage with the world around them.\n\nNow, they’re moving early to adopt marketing Agents and building with … We are proud to support their team.","metrics":{"likes":330,"comments":14,"shares":10,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Credibility post: Snap is 'moving early' to adopt marketing Agents and building with Profound, social proof that a focused, agent-led approach is where large teams are heading.","why_zh":"背书型帖子：Snap“抢先”采用营销智能体并与 Profound 合作，证明聚焦、由智能体驱动的做法正被大型团队采纳。","textNote":"Caption shortened to 300 characters; the omitted middle is marked with an ellipsis and the closing line is kept."},{"postId":682464570,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-06-01","img":"e682464570","text":"Introducing Skills. \n\nBuild your brand voice, content rules, and AEO playbook once. Apply them anywhere you're generating content.\n\nhttps://lnkd.in/e8pNrsit","metrics":{"likes":46,"comments":null,"shares":2,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Explains Skills: set brand voice, content rules and the AEO playbook once, then apply them wherever content is generated, focus through reuse.","why_zh":"介绍 Skills：品牌语调、内容规则和 AEO 打法只需设定一次，即可用于所有内容生成场景，以复用实现聚焦。"},{"postId":682464578,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-05-19","img":"e682464578","text":"Agent Assistant is live. Create Profound Agents with your voice.\n\nDescribe any marketing process you want to automate, and Agent Assistant builds it in minutes. \n\n• Spin up a Reddit Agent that pings your brand team when a competitor gets cited … Voice dictation saves time. Try it inside Profound.","metrics":{"likes":39,"comments":1,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Demo of building Profound Agents by voice (a Reddit citation alert, a demand-gen landing-page agent): automation that frees attention for fewer priorities. Its closing 'Try it inside Profound' addresses existing users, so it is treated as MOFU.","why_zh":"演示用语音搭建 Profound 智能体（Reddit 引用提醒、需求生成落地页智能体），用自动化腾出精力聚焦少数重点。结尾的“在 Profound 内试用”面向现有用户，因此归为 MOFU。","textNote":"Caption shortened to 300 characters; the omitted middle is marked with an ellipsis and the closing line is kept."}],"bofu":[{"postId":682464551,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-07-02","img":"e682464551","text":"Dashboards are dead.\n\nFor years, marketing tools have told you what's happening. More clicks, more visitors, more mentions. But none of them ever told you what to actually do next...\n\nToday, we're launching Aim: the first AI teammate built to THINK like a … Sign up → https://lnkd.in/gazyWsrT","metrics":{"likes":924,"comments":557,"shares":139,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"'Dashboards are dead': Aim finds the moments that matter and hands over a plan already built, the sharpest 'less but better' message here, closing with a sign-up for the live walkthrough.","why_zh":"“仪表盘已死”：Aim 找出真正重要的时刻并直接给出现成方案，是这里最鲜明的“少而精”信息，结尾引导报名直播演示。","imgNote":"Frame at 0:16 of the post video (SOMIN-hosted copy); the stored thumbnail is a solid black frame.","textNote":"Caption shortened to 300 characters; the omitted middle is marked with an ellipsis and the closing line is kept."},{"postId":682464547,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-06-26","img":"e682464547","text":"We introduced the Marketing Engineer role at Zero Click SF in April. Here's what happened next:\n\nNick Lafferty, Founding Marketing Engineer at Profound, shared that brands like Google and Figma have already hired this role, and thousands of marketers have … Sign up here → https://lnkd.in/ebqYVShh","metrics":{"likes":47,"comments":3,"shares":2,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Sign-up for the Zero Click NY session on the Marketing Engineer role, the job that turns scattered marketing tasks into systems.","why_zh":"Zero Click 纽约“营销工程师”专场的报名帖，这一角色正是把零散营销任务变成系统的人。","textNote":"Caption shortened to 300 characters; the omitted middle is marked with an ellipsis and the closing line is kept."},{"postId":682475353,"src":"paid","net":"google_display","date":"2026-07-18","img":"ea682475353","text":"Profound vs. Searchable. See Why Teams Are Switching to Profound. Monitor 10+ LLMs in real time. Book a demo and see the difference.","metrics":{"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Comparison display ad for the moment a team is choosing between tools (variants name Searchable and Semrush), with a book-a-demo CTA.","why_zh":"面向团队在工具间做选择时刻的对比展示广告（不同版本分别对比 Searchable 与 Semrush），带“预约演示”行动号召。","lastSeen":"2026-07-19","placement":["APPS","DISPLAY_PARTNERS","GOOGLE_MAIL","YOUTUBE"]}]},"kpi":{"evidencePosts":151,"engagement":17534,"brandPosts":13,"brandEng":2469},"sov":{"brandShare":23.6,"categoryShare":17.3,"brandPosts":13,"brandTotal":55,"catPosts":138,"catTotal":797},"trend":{"months":["2026-04","2026-05","2026-06","2026-07"],"brand":[3,2,3,5],"category":[16,50,45,27]},"trendNote":"Monthly post counts from posts-aggregate with clusterIds=[55094] over the study window 2026-04-20..2026-07-19; first and last months are partial. Category = the 8 competitor profiles combined."},{"id":"p3","name":"Connections over contact lists","name_zh":"真连接胜过名片堆","verdict":"contested","headline":"Networking is about genuine connections, not just collecting business cards.","headline_zh":"人脉在于真诚连接，而非收集名片。","territory":"SaaS and AI teams short on resources, recognition, useful networking and tailored education, which leaves them under-exposed and slow to convert. Profound is active here through events and its partner program, slightly above the category on share.","territory_zh":"SaaS 与 AI 团队缺资源、缺认可、缺有效人脉和针对性的学习资源，因此曝光不足、转化缓慢。Profound 通过活动和合作伙伴计划活跃于此，份额略高于品类。","persona":{"themeId":55085,"title":"The Strategic Innovator","characterId":1270,"characterName":"Evelyn Dataforge","summary":"Tech strategist leading a team at an AI startup: analytical, curious and adaptable, driven by knowledge, growth and recognition, and set on staying ahead of AI, SEO and digital-marketing trends.","created":false,"studyId":7136},"tension":{"themeId":55082,"type":"pain_points","title":"Navigating the Challenges of Growth and Connection in the SaaS and AI Landscape","summary":"SaaS and AI businesses face limited resources for growth and conversion, few effective networking and recognition opportunities, hard-to-reach market insights and little tailored education or community.","studyId":7135},"angle":{"id":14378,"type":"sociological","title":"Ineffective Networking Opportunities","text":"Without effective networking, businesses miss the industry relationships that drive collaboration, visibility and growth (Social Capital Theory).","created":false},"story":{"id":1860,"title":"Network Fail","narrative":"At her first San Francisco tech conference Evelyn chases big names and slick pitches and leaves feeling inadequate. Then a simple offer of coffee to a quiet attendee becomes a real conversation about shared AI interests and a project she can contribute to. She stops collecting contacts and starts building intentional relationships, which bring partners, collaborators and friends.","created":false},"propositions":[{"id":5309,"type":"usp","title":"Connect Deeply, Grow Effectively.","text":"Build authentic connections that drive growth with Profound Platform's AI insights. AI Marketer acts as a bridge, using data insights to identify genuine partnership opportunities, enhancing collaboration beyond superficial connections.","created":true,"variantId":22589,"focus":"AI Marketer: a marketing expert that investigates your data, identifies opportunities, and does the work while you stay in the loop","storyId":1860},{"id":5307,"type":"rtb","title":"More than Connections: Grow Genuine Relationships with Profound.","text":"Cultivate Authentic Connections: Transform Networking with AI. Profound Platform helps marketers not just collect data, but cultivate actionable insights that lead to meaningful partnerships.","created":true,"variantId":22579,"focus":"Plaid grew LLM referral traffic by over 300%, with conversions up 210%, using Profound","storyId":1860},{"id":5305,"type":"product_features","title":"Elevate Your Networking: Transform Insights into Relationships.","text":"Unlock the power of meaningful connections in AI. Utilize external context from tools like Slack and Notion to enrich conversations and insights on Profound Platform.","created":true,"variantId":22571,"focus":"Agents with reusable Skills and an External MCP that pulls context from Slack, Notion and G2","storyId":1860}],"examples":{"tofu":[],"mofu":[{"postId":683091274,"src":"paid","net":"youtube","date":"2026-09-30","img":"ea683091274","text":"See how brands track and optimize their presence across every AI search engine","metrics":{"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":{"bucket":"BELOW_AVERAGE","conf":0.829},"why":"YouTube ad that sends viewers to a Profound webinar page on tracking AI-search presence, the education and exposure gap this tension names; SOMIN predicts below-average clickability.","why_zh":"YouTube 广告把观众引向 Profound 关于追踪 AI 搜索存在感的网络研讨会页面，正对应本张力中的学习资源与曝光缺口；SOMIN 预测其点击力低于平均。","lastSeen":"2026-09-29","placement":["YOUTUBE","VIDEO_PARTNERS"],"landing":"https://www.tryprofound.com/webinars/marketing-team-future","imgNote":"YouTube thumbnail of the ad video (id gP3mkqt-w-4 from SOMIN); it shows the $180M Series D visual."},{"postId":682464550,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-06-25","img":"e682464550","text":"829 Studios is now a verified Profound Partner 🤝\n\nThe team at 829 Studios has worked with brands like Ramp, Github, and Cloudflare to execute strategic marketing initiatives. They are technical, creative, and growth-minded at once. Exactly the kind of team that thrives in the AI era.\n\nAs a…","metrics":{"likes":65,"comments":8,"shares":2,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Partner-program post: a verified agency that has worked with Ramp, GitHub and Cloudflare now builds with Profound, relationships used as proof.","why_zh":"合作伙伴计划帖子：曾服务 Ramp、GitHub、Cloudflare 的认证代理商加入 Profound，以合作关系作为背书。"},{"postId":682464508,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-07-09","img":"e682464508","text":"ClickSlice is now a verified Profound Partner 🤝\n\nClickSlice is a bespoke SEO agency based in London, helping brands scale faster by blending proven growth fundamentals with cutting-edge AI search … As a partner, they're using Profound to help their clients win. Welcome to the program, ClickSlice.","metrics":{"likes":40,"comments":3,"shares":2,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"A second partner welcome (a London SEO agency blending growth fundamentals with AI search) that shows the network growing through named collaborators.","why_zh":"第二条合作伙伴欢迎帖（一家融合增长基本功与 AI 搜索策略的伦敦 SEO 代理商），通过具名合作者展示网络在扩大。","textNote":"Caption shortened to 300 characters; the omitted middle is marked with an ellipsis and the closing line is kept."}],"bofu":[{"postId":682464706,"src":"paid","net":"google_search","date":"2025-07-13","img":"ea682464706","text":"GEO Platform - Own Your AI Presence - Analyze Your Brand Free\nSee how AI engines represent your brand. Track citations, analyze prompts, take action.","metrics":{"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":{"bucket":"BELOW_AVERAGE","conf":0.859},"why":"Search ad with a free brand-analysis CTA for under-exposed brands ('Own your AI presence'); SOMIN predicts below-average clickability.","why_zh":"面向曝光不足品牌的搜索广告（“掌控你的 AI 存在感”），带免费品牌分析的行动号召；SOMIN 预测其点击力低于平均。","lastSeen":"2026-07-17","placement":["GOOGLE_SEARCH","SEARCH_PARTNERS"],"imgNote":"Typographic rendering of the ad copy stored in SOMIN; this text ad has no image in the source."},{"postId":682464530,"src":"organic","net":"linkedin","date":"2026-04-01","img":"e682464530","text":"Officially announcing our Zero Click by Profound SF locked line up for April 8.\n\nHumbled to have incredible leaders taking the stage bringing insights from:\n• Stripe\n• OpenAI\n• Reddit\n• Parallel\n• Expedia\n• Figma\n• Sequoia … We're one week out, request your spot now → https://lnkd.in/eDdj8WrE","metrics":{"likes":201,"comments":14,"shares":9,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Speaker line-up for Zero Click SF (Stripe, OpenAI, Reddit, Figma, Sequoia and more) ending in 'request your spot now': networking with a direct registration CTA.","why_zh":"Zero Click 旧金山大会讲者阵容（Stripe、OpenAI、Reddit、Figma、红杉等），结尾“立即申请席位”：以直接报名行动号召承接人脉需求。","textNote":"Caption shortened to 300 characters; the omitted middle is marked with an ellipsis and the closing line is kept."},{"postId":682464705,"src":"paid","net":"google_search","date":"2025-07-13","img":"ea682464705","text":"GEO Agency Tool - Scale GEO Across Clients - Book an Agency Demo\nGR0 took a client from $1K to $100K/mo in AI sales. Scale GEO across all clients.","metrics":{"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"views":null},"score":null,"why":"Agency-facing search ad with a book-a-demo CTA for partners who grow by scaling GEO across clients; the GR0 result is the ad's own claim.","why_zh":"面向代理商的搜索广告，带“预约代理商演示”行动号召，针对靠为多个客户规模化 GEO 来增长的伙伴；GR0 的成绩为广告自身的说法。","lastSeen":"2026-07-17","placement":["GOOGLE_SEARCH","SEARCH_PARTNERS"]}]},"kpi":{"evidencePosts":92,"engagement":7733,"brandPosts":7,"brandEng":470},"sov":{"brandShare":11.5,"categoryShare":9.2,"brandPosts":7,"brandTotal":61,"catPosts":85,"catTotal":923},"trend":{"months":["2026-04","2026-05","2026-06","2026-07"],"brand":[1,0,4,2],"category":[32,22,21,10]},"trendNote":"Monthly post counts from posts-aggregate with clusterIds=[55082] over the study window 2026-04-01..2026-07-19; first and last months are partial. Category = the 8 competitor profiles combined."}],"created":{"studies":[],"characters":[],"angles":[],"stories":[],"products":[1474],"propositions":[5295,5297,5298,5299,5301,5303,5305,5307,5309]},"notes":["Pillars reuse the workspace's only 3 SOMIN stories (#1858, #1859, #1860); each covers a different pain-point tension, so no studies, characters, angles or stories were created. All three use persona theme 55085 'The Strategic Innovator' and character #1270 Evelyn Dataforge.","Pillars p1 and p2 come from study 7136 B-ORG-WS-90D (organic, 2026-04-20 to 2026-07-19). Pillar p3's tension 55082 comes from study 7135 B-ORG-TREND-W4 2026Q2-3 (organic, 2026-04-01 to 2026-07-19), so its share of voice uses that study's totals.","Gap: Profound's strongest territory, AI-search brand visibility (themes 55090 in study 7136 and 55080 in study 7135, 34 to 37 Profound posts each), has no SOMIN story, so it is not a pillar here. The existing stories lean to work-life, marketing complexity and networking.","KPI and share of voice use the per-brand counts in studies-get (pain_points themes only). Share = theme posts / all pain-point posts in the same study: Profound 55 of 852 in study 7136 and 61 of 984 in study 7135; competitors 797 and 923.","Verdict rules: owned when Profound's share is at least 1.3x the category's; contested from 0.7x to 1.3x with at least 5 Profound posts; emerging when Profound has fewer than 5 posts in the theme; whitespace at 2 or fewer posts or below 0.5x. p1 is at parity on share (7.3% vs 6.8%) but has only 4 posts and 181 engagement, against Semrush's 34 posts and 13,012 engagement, so it is emerging. p2: 23.6% vs 17.3% (1.36x), owned. p3: 11.5% vs 9.2% (1.25x), contested.","Trend: posts-aggregate with clusterIds=[theme] and the 9-profile PROFILE breakdown, month by month inside each study window. April 2026 (from the 20th for study 7136) and July 2026 (to the 19th) are partial months. Category counts are all posts minus Profound's; the profile buckets summed to the totals with no overlap.","Examples are Profound's own content only. Organic posts come from posts-search with clusterIds=[tension] (study window dates are needed, because the same search without dates returned nothing). The clusters overlap: 682464533, 682464602, 682464508 and 682464535 sit in two clusters, and each post was used in one pillar only. Paid ads are not in the organic clusters (clusterIds plus ADS_LIBRARY returned nothing), so ads come from Profound's ADS_LIBRARY posts (LAST_90_DAYS, pages 1 to 3, pageSize 8) matched to pillars by their copy. Without dates the search returned only 4 recent ads, and page 2 repeated some page-1 items.","Score gate (confidence > 0.80): 3 of 21 real examples pass, all paid and all BELOW_AVERAGE (682464758 0.813, 683091274 0.829, 682464706 0.859). No organic post passes. For multi-image posts the first or cover image's score is used: the hackathon carousel 682464553 has later slides scored ABOVE_AVERAGE 0.92 and AVERAGE 0.90, but its cover is AVERAGE 0.52, so score = null. Text ad 682464497 ('Get a Free Brand Audit') scores BELOW_AVERAGE 0.799, just under the gate, and is not used.","Funnel calls: webinar, event and session sign-ups count as BOFU, and so do search ads with 'Analyze your brand free' or 'Book a demo'. Partner and customer announcements count as MOFU (credibility). Agent Assistant's in-product 'Try it inside Profound' counts as MOFU. POSSIBLE Miami ('reach out and meet up', no link) counts as TOFU.","Stage gaps: p3 has no TOFU example, because cluster 55082 holds no awareness-type Profound post and the cluster search was not empty, so no fallback was used. p1 TOFU has 1 example. p2 TOFU adds one existing concept render (gen3698_2, made for planned post s4, which cites story #1859). gen3698_1 is not used.","Images: 682464551 (Aim launch) has an all-black stored thumbnail and its LinkedIn poster returned 403, so the image is the 0:16 frame of the SOMIN-hosted post video (on-screen text: 'Your AI marketer that comes with ideas'). The YouTube ad images (682464758, 683091274) are the i.ytimg.com thumbnails for the video ids stored in SOMIN; 683091274's thumbnail shows the $180M Series D visual. Search-ad images are Google's archived ad renders stored in SOMIN; the on-image copy was read and checked. 682464706 has no image in SOMIN, so ea682464706.jpg is a plain rendering of its stored headline and description, and it is labelled that way on the image.","Metrics: organic posts are LinkedIn company posts; shares = LinkedIn reposts, views are not available, and a count is null where SOMIN does not report it. Ads carry no engagement metrics. For many Google ads SOMIN's postDate is 2025-07-13, which looks like a first-seen date; the last-seen date is in lastSeen. Ad 682464766 duplicates 682464758 (same copy and score) and is not used.","Product #1474 'Profound Platform' was created on profile 20501 (b2b) using only facts from Profound's own posts and ads: Aim and AI Marketer launch posts, the Profound Index launch, the Plaid case post (LLM referral traffic up over 300%, conversions up 210%), Forrester and Gartner recognition posts, the Estee Lauder and Snap partnership posts, partner-program posts, and the ad perks 'Analyze your brand free' and 'Book a demo'. No prices were added.","Propositions #5295 to #5309 (9 in total, 3 per story: usp, rtb, product_features) were created with propositions-create, and each holds 5 SOMIN-generated variants. One variant is shown per proposition (variantId). The networking-framed copy for story #1860 (for example, AI Marketer finding partnership opportunities) is SOMIN-generated positioning, not a product capability detected in Profound's content."]},{"ea682464758":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682464528":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682464591":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682464533":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682464602":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","ea682502243":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","ea682464736":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682464553":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682464692":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","gen3698_2":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682464572":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682464570":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682464578":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682464551":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682464547":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","ea682475353":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","ea683091274":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682464550":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682464508":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","ea682464706":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","e682464530":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","ea682464705":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"});
